Owner' s Rights and Obligations
Right to registerVoter: The owner has the right to register a new voter if they have not been registered.
Obligation to startVoting: The owner must initiate the voting process by setting votingLive = true.
Obligation to endVoting: The owner must end the voting process when it is complete by setting votingLive = false.
Right to totalVotesFor: After voting ends, the owner has the right to check and display the final vote count for each candidate.
Voter' s Rights and Obligations
Right to vote: If the voter is registered and voting is active, they can cast a vote for a valid candidate.
Obligation to followVotingRules: The voter must ensure they cast their vote only during the active voting period.


